export anchor TarotStyle:
    number: 100
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Tarot
    idea: The dashboard read as a gentle tarot spread on pale lavender parchment, with arched gold-lined cards, roman numerals and fine line drawings, and the fortnight drawn as two constellations.
    base: light
    palette:
        lavenderParchment: #f6f2fb, the page
        cardCream: #fffdf6, cards, panels and fields
        nightIndigo: #2a2350, text, numerals, the primary button and week two stars
        dusk: #4f4870, meta lines, captions and axis labels
        goldInk: #7a5a12, small gold text, numerals on cards and week one stars
        goldLeaf: #b8913a, frames, rules and line art, never text
        mist: #e7def2, the progress track and the focus halo
        sage: #2f5d46, On track
        amber: #8a4e0b, At risk
        garnet: #9b2335, Behind and overdue
    type:
        Capitals and numerals use Trajan Pro, Optima, Palatino Linotype,
        Palatino, Georgia, serif, uppercase and tracked 0.1 to 0.3em. Text
        uses Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino, Georgia, serif.
        The brand is 30 to 54px caps tracked 0.3em, the greeting 34 to 48px
        italic, altar numbers 52px, section heads 15px caps tracked 0.24em
        over a 15px italic subtitle, card names 14px caps, body 16px at 1.6
        and numerals 12 to 15px.
    layout:
        The header is centred. A top row holds a pill search field, the bell,
        an indigo pill New project with a gold inner ring, and the user in a
        gold ringed disc. Below sit a line crest with a moon, the spaced caps
        brand and caps nav links with a small star before the current one.
        The greeting is centred under a gold caps line, The reading for
        Saturday 31 October 2026, with a garnet italic warning. The four
        totals stand as an altar of four arched windows I to IV with large
        numerals. The spread is a row of six arched cards, each with a gold
        frame and a second hairline frame inside, a roman numeral at the top,
        a gold line drawing, a star, a wheel, a lantern, scales, a blossom or
        a winged letter, and the name in caps on a rule at the base. Under
        each card sit team and due, a thin indigo progress bead, percent and
        tasks, and the status. Below, a constellation chart sits beside
        Recent signs, a list marked with small gold stars. Cards go three
        across below 1100px and two across on phones.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px between cards, 40 to 64px between sections and generous margins inside frames.
    density: Calm and sparse. Little text on each card.
    corners: Arched tops on cards and altar windows, a 50 percent horizontal radius over 56 to 80px, with 6px base corners. Buttons and fields are pills.
    borders: A 1px gold leaf frame with a second hairline 5px inside, like a printed card border.
    shadows: One soft violet lift, 0 6px 20px rgba(42,35,80,0.10), on cards and panels.
    icons:
        Fine 1.2px gold line drawings for the cards. Status marks are solid,
        a sun with rays for On track, a crescent moon for At risk and a
        lightning bolt for Behind and overdue, each beside caps words.
    focus: A 2px indigo outline offset 3px inside a 6px mist halo.
    tone: Soft and a little ceremonial but plain, such as The reading, The spread and Recent signs.
